{"id":"2bc4d1a14a37aabf","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-maximal-fixed-point.md","title":"最大代数固定点与极大一致固定点","display":"df-maximal-fixed-point — 最大代数固定点与极大一致固定点","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-maximal-fixed-point","aliases":["91-df-maximal-fixed-point","91-df-Kripke-maximal"],"display":"df-maximal-fixed-point — 最大代数固定点与极大一致固定点","depends_on":["[[91-df-jump-operator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-maximal-fixed-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-maximal-fixed-point</span><span>91-df-Kripke-maximal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-maximal-fixed-point — 最大代数固定点与极大一致固定点"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" href=\"?note=ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" title=\"91-df-jump-operator\">91-df-jump-operator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" href=\"?note=ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" title=\"91-df-jump-operator\">91-df-jump-operator</a> 的幂集单调算子。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)=\\{X\\in\\operatorname{Fix}(J):\\operatorname{ConInfo}(X)\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)=\\{X\\in\\operatorname{Fix}(J):\\operatorname{ConInfo}(X)\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\\quad\nX_{\\max}\\coloneqq\\bigcup\\{Y\\subseteq C_T:Y\\subseteq J(Y)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\\quad\nX_{\\max}\\coloneqq\\bigcup\\{Y\\subseteq C_T:Y\\subseteq J(Y)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"J(X_{\\max})=X_{\\max},\\qquad\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\\ (Y\\subseteq X_{\\max}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[J(X_{\\max})=X_{\\max},\\qquad\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\\ (Y\\subseteq X_{\\max}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MaxFix}_c(X)\\coloneqq X\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\land\n\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\,(X\\subseteq Y\\to X=Y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MaxFix}_c(X)\\coloneqq X\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\land\n\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\,(X\\subseteq Y\\to X=Y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>“最大”是包含全部固定点的唯一 greatest 元素；“极大一致”只排除严格一致扩张，可以有多个。上述最大代数固定点由 Knaster–Tarski 得到，允许过剩，不能当成最大的三值解释。\n从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_T\">\\(C_T\\)</span> 出发在后继取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span>、非零极限取交，也在集合阶段稳定到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{\\max}\">\\(X_{\\max}\\)</span>。其固定点性质由单调性证明；这不声称所有固定点的并本来就无需再次闭包。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 15.5、Lemmata 15.6–15.8、Definitions 15.9–15.11、Lemmata 15.12–15.14，印刷页 189–196，PDF 页 200–207；Knaster–Tarski 固定点定理（本节点补充的序论形式）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-jump-operator","status":"resolved","id":"ae9eced0b12cbd2a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-jump-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-jump-operator","status":"resolved","id":"ae9eced0b12cbd2a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$J$ 为 [[91-df-jump-operator]] 的幂集单调算子。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)=\\{X\\in\\operatorname{Fix}(J):\\operatorname{ConInfo}(X)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\\quad\nX_{\\max}\\coloneqq\\bigcup\\{Y\\subseteq C_T:Y\\subseteq J(Y)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"J(X_{\\max})=X_{\\max},\\qquad\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\\ (Y\\subseteq X_{\\max}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MaxFix}_c(X)\\coloneqq X\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\land\n\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\,(X\\subseteq Y\\to X=Y).","display":true},{"tex":"C_T","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"X_{\\max}","display":false}],"bytes":1601,"backlinks":[{"id":"d12ffdb5e1b32a31","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-54","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-maximal-fixed-point]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-61","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-coded-syntax.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-trut